.Dd August 4, 2026
.Dt SHUTDOWN 8
.Os "BigFred OS"
.Sh NAME
.Nm shutdown
.Nd ordered poweroff, reboot, or halt via microinit
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl -socket Ns = Ns Ar path
.Op Fl h | Fl P | Fl r | Fl H
.Op Ar now
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
asks the running
.Xr microinit 8
daemon (PID 1) to stop supervised services in reverse dependency order, run
the late-unmount script, and then power off, reboot, or halt the machine.
Communication uses the Unix control socket
.Pq default Pa /data/run/microinit.sock .
.Pp
If the socket is missing or the request fails
.Nm
falls back to BusyBox
.Pa /sbin/poweroff ,
.Pa /sbin/reboot ,
or
.Pa /sbin/halt .
.Pp
Delayed shutdown and wall messages are not implemented; the optional
.Ar now
token is accepted for SysV compatibility and ignored.
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl h , Fl P , Cm poweroff
Power off (default).
.It Fl r , Cm reboot
Reboot.
.It Fl H , Cm halt
Halt without powering off.
.It Fl -socket Ar path
Control socket path (default
.Pa /data/run/microinit.sock ).
.It Fl -help
Print usage and exit.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr microinit 8 ,
.Xr unmount.sh 8
.Sh AUTHORS
.An BigFred
